// STM_INVESTIGATEBODY_CHATTING_TALKERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4034203131" "Oh, darling.  Let's just move the bag and discuss the grisly details of how it came to be later, shall we?  Really, I am growing quite bored now."

